# App Versioning Rule

## Goal

Keep a visible, monotonically increasing app version for internal tracking.

## Version Source Of Truth

- Store the app version only in `@lib/version.ts` as `APP_VERSION`.
- Treat `APP_VERSION` as the canonical value displayed in the dashboard UI.

## Bump Trigger

- If an agent session makes one or more code changes, bump `APP_VERSION` exactly once before finishing.
- Do not bump multiple times in the same session for multiple file edits.
- If no files are changed, do not bump the version.

## Bump Format

- Keep the version in `X.XX` format.
- Increment by `0.01` each time.
- Examples:
  - `1.00` -> `1.01`
  - `1.09` -> `1.10`
  - `1.99` -> `2.00`

## Implementation Notes

- Preserve two decimal places.
- Ensure the dashboard-facing version display uses `APP_VERSION` from `@lib/version.ts`.
